# Brewfile.stack.mail - Mail clients
#
# Stack tier: opt-in per machine with --stack mail, on any role and under
# either ownership.
#
# Canary Mail moved here out of Brewfile.apps.workstation, where it landed on
# every workstation automatically. It is a paid client wanted on specific
# machines, not a function of having a big screen - the same reasoning that
# pulled the creative and local-AI clusters out of the shared tiers.
#
# Usage: brew bundle --file=Brewfile.stack.mail

